        "The detector returned zero findings. Independent review resolved the responsive text-token collision, layout shift, mobile title wrapping, and runtime fallback; blocked-script fallback evidence is captured in artifacts/design/fallback-390.png."
      ]
    }
  },
  "ownerFeedback": {
    "decision": "delegated",
    "note": "Owner requested the integration, approved the direction, and delegated implementation in the established preserve lane."
